   <dc:title><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Wild Fish &amp; The Bell Nest — Cookaki, Koukáki, Athens</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:title>
   <dc:description><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Cookaki&apos;s signature Bell fish dish — wild Aegean fish fillet baked inside a hollowed marrow &quot;bell nest&quot; with trahanás, served on a bed of wild samphire greens with avgolémono sauce. Petmeza 5, Koukáki, Athens 117 42, two minutes from the Acropolis Museum.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:description>
   <dc:creator><rdf:Seq><rdf:li>Bell — Little Noe Team</rdf:li></rdf:Seq></dc:creator>
